          %h2#references References
          %p
            The general discussion of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tangent+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category"} tangent (∞,1)-category
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"}> Jacob Lurie
              ,
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Deformation+Theory"} Deformation Theory
              \.
          %p The model category theoretic presentation over model sites of commutative monoids is discussed in
          %ul#ToenVezzosiI
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bertrand+To%C3%ABn"}> Bertrand Toën
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gabriele+Vezzosi"} Gabriele Vezzosi
              %em Homotopical Algebraic Geometry I: Topos theory
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0207028"}> arXiv:0207028
              )
          %ul#ToenVezzosiII
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bertrand+To%C3%ABn"}> Bertrand Toën
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gabriele+Vezzosi"} Gabriele Vezzosi
              %em Homotopical Algebraic Geometry II: geometric stacks and applications
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0404373"}> arXiv:0404373
              )
          %p
            A discussion specific to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dg-geometry"} dg-geometry
            with an emphasis on the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometric+%E2%88%9E-function+theory"} geometric ∞-function theory
            of quasicoherent
            = succeed "-stacks" do
